<div
   style='background:#f8fafc;padding:32px 12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#161b22;'
>
   <div
      style='max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #d9e2ec;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(22,27,34,0.06);'
   >
      <div style='height:4px;background:#facc15;'></div>
      <div style='background:#1e2630;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;'>
         {{#if logoBase64}}
            <img
               src='data:image/png;base64,{{{logoBase64}}}'
               alt='VACA'
               width='220'
               style='display:inline-block;width:220px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;'
            />
         {{else}}
            <div
               style='font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#ffffff;'
            >
               VACA
            </div>
         {{/if}}
      </div>

      <div style='padding:28px 24px 18px 24px;'>
         <h1
            style='font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#161b22;'
         >
            {{#if name}}Ola {{name}},{{else}}Ola,{{/if}}
         </h1>

         <p
            style='margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#5a6672;'
         >
            Use o codigo abaixo para acessar sua conta:
         </p>

         <div
            style='margin:20px 0;background:#fff9e0;border:1px solid #fff2b8;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 16px;text-align:center;'
         >
            <span
               style='display:inline-block;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:6px;color:#161b22;'
            >
               {{code}}
            </span>
         </div>

         <p
            style='margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5a6672;'
         >
            Codigo valido por
            {{challengeTtlMinutes}}
            minutos.
         </p>

         <p
            style='margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5a6672;'
         >
            Se preferir, voce tambem pode entrar com o link magico:
         </p>

         <div style='margin:0 0 16px 0;'>
            <a
               href='{{magicLink}}'
               style='display:inline-block;background:#161b22;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;'
            >
               Entrar com link magico
            </a>
         </div>

         <p
            style='margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#667789;word-break:break-all;'
         >
            Caso o botao nao funcione, copie e cole este link no navegador:
            <a
               href='{{magicLink}}'
               style='color:#a16207;text-decoration:underline;'
            >{{magicLink}}</a>
         </p>
      </div>

      <div
         style='padding:16px 24px;background:#eef3f8;border-top:1px solid #d9e2ec;'
      >
         <p style='margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#667789;'>
            Se voce nao solicitou este acesso, ignore este e-mail.
         </p>
         <p
            style='margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#667789;'
         >
            {{appName}}
         </p>
      </div>
   </div>
</div>